title: Faolan
---
Faolan: Hello, how can I help you?
-> I'm a warlock and I know of your secret.
Faolan: Oh dear.
-> You don't have to worry.
-> Mr. Penelope hired me to win back your trust.
-> I will keep it a secret.
Faolan: Ah really now?
Faolan: Well, then. I have no choice but to wait and see.
Faolan: What did he hire you for?
-> To do tarot readings for guests and employees. Would you be interested in a reading?
Faolan: That's fantastic! I would love that!
Faolan: How did Mr. Penelope know I love tarot cards?
-> Your friend Rini told me.
Faolan: Ah Rini! I love that little bunbun.
Faolan: She's like a sister to me!
Faolan: Alrighty, I'm available now if you want to do a reading?
===